      "content": "thanks. i found the log. it's a bit messy but i'm seeing some weird stuff. they were at my block on tuesday at 2am, then again on thursday at 3am, then friday afternoon. the 2am and 3am ones feel way too specific to be just random repairs. if they're trying to map out house vibrations, they'd want to do it when the street is quiet so they can hear the actual movement inside the homes, right? do you see how those weird timing gaps could be intentional?",
